{"id":441,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"徳・健・財の精神と六年一貫の学びで人を育てる","feature_description":"清風南海は「徳・健・財」を備え、社会のために尽くす人物の育成を建学の精神に掲げます。中学・高校の六年間を一つの流れとして捉えた独自のカリキュラムで、学力と人間教育を進めます。授業では思考力を生かす学習指導を行い、学校行事や体験プログラムでは五感を使って主体的に学ぶ機会を設けています。グローバル探究ゼミや宗教教育を含め、学びと生活の両面で自立的精神を育てます。","clubs":[{"id":8654,"name":"剣道部(男・女)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seifunankai.ac.jp/about/bukatsudo/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8655,"name":"硬式テニス部(男・女)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seifunankai.ac.jp/about/bukatsudo/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8656,"name":"サッカー部(男・女)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seifunankai.ac.jp/about/bukatsudo/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8657,"name":"陸上部(男・女)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seifunankai.ac.jp/about/bukatsudo/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8658,"name":"ソフトボール部(男)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seifunankai.ac.jp/about/bukatsudo/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8659,"name":"卓球部(男・女)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seifunankai.ac.jp/about/bukatsudo/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8660,"name":"バスケットボール部(男・女)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seifunankai.ac.jp/about/bukatsudo/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8664,"name":"インターアクト部(男・女)","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.seifunankai.ac.jp/about/bukatsudo/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8665,"name":"吹奏楽部(男・女)","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.seifunankai.ac.jp/about/bukatsudo/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8666,"name":"美術部(男・女)","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.seifunankai.ac.jp/about/bukatsudo/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8667,"name":"囲碁将棋部(男・女)","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.seifunankai.ac.jp/about/bukatsudo/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8668,"name":"科学研究部(男・女)","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.seifunankai.ac.jp/about/bukatsudo/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8669,"name"